description: >
  A small, leak-proof bottle. It can hold what the Sealing Unique Ability seals, with no Sealing
  Talisman - 1 Action to seal it.
text: >
  Sealing Bottle: A small, leak-proof bottle designed for long-term storage.
  –Craft DC: Expert
  –Details: N/A
  –Effects: A bottle that can be used to hold a small amount of liquid. Additionally, it can be
  used for the Sealing Unique Ability. This Item doesn’t require the Sealing Talisman, but you
  still must spend 1 Action to seal the Item.

